# No AI commit attribution

When creating or amending git commits in this repo:

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any `Co-authored-by` trailer for Cursor, Copilot, Claude, or other AI tools
- Do not add `Made-with: Cursor`, `Generated by Cursor`, `Signed-off-by: Cursor`, or similar
- Do not mention Cursor, Copilot, or any AI assistant in the commit subject or body
- Write the commit message only — describe the change, matching this repo's existing style

```
# BAD
git commit -m "Limit football browse to Premier League.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>"

# GOOD
git commit -m "Limit football browse to Premier League."
```
